Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:11.60,Flashback,Friend A,0000,0000,0000,,What? The {\i1}Super Scary Movie{\i0} series went up to 5?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:13.36,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,Up to 7, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.16,Flashback,Friend B,0000,0000,0000,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:17.89,Flashback,Friend B,0000,0000,0000,,The seventh one must be really out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.89,0:00:20.80,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,It became a completely different thing by 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:22.95,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,It's not even a parody movie anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.41,0:00:25.27,Flashback,Friend A,0000,0000,0000,,Then what kind of movie is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.52,0:00:30.53,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,Convoluted sitcom plus \Nlineage horror, I suppose?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.53,0:00:31.67,Flashback,Friend A,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:35.94,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,By a total fluke, and the grandchild of \Nthe main character from 1 ends up living
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:38.57,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,in a shared house with the \Ngrandchild of the culprit from 2
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.57,0:00:42.35,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,and the grandchild of the \Nfirst person who died in 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:45.96,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,but it turns out it's a haunted house, \Nso they call in a spirit medium.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:46.77,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,That's the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:48.98,Flashback,Friend B,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:51.05,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,It bored me to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:52.90,Flashback,Friend A,0000,0000,0000,,Who'd watch something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:56.56,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,What's interesting, though, \Nis that the guy from 5 and 6—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.15,0:00:58.43,Flashback,Sayama,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.43,0:01:00.16,Flashback,Sayama,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:04.66,Flashback,Sayama,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I tell you not to use this room \Nbecause we're making it our club room now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.96,0:01:10.37,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,B-But you haven't been using it lately, \Nso I thought it was fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.35,0:01:16.11,Flashback,Itou,0000,0000,0000,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.05,0:01:18.85,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,So, well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.47,0:01:23.92,Flashback,Sayama,0000,0000,0000,,Just get out of here already, \Nyou cockroaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.64,0:01:26.75,Flashback,Friend A,0000,0000,0000,,L-Let's go, Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.72,0:01:32.40,Flashback,Honda,0000,0000,0000,,Next time you use it, we'll send you flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.78,0:01:34.31,Flashback,Nishimura,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, score!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.31,0:01:36.43,Flashback,Friend B,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.95,0:01:40.97,Flashback,Itou,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.21,0:01:43.53,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,I'm taking it home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.01,0:01:45.77,Flashback,Itou,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:56.60,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,Move your foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.69,0:02:01.82,Flashback,Friend A,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, stop it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:05.23,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,I'm taking this home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.23,0:02:06.86,Flashback,Junpei,0000,0000,0000,,So could you move your foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.06,0:02:20.00,Flashback,Friend A;B,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.24,0:02:29.69,Flashback,Itou,0000,0000,0000,,Close the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.08,0:02:31.40,Flashback,Honda,0000,0000,0000,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.22,0:02:49.64,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\move(310,212,310,212)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H1F1C18&\bord0\shad0}Movie Club
